# Paths a history scrub removes from this repo by git filter-repo --invert-paths.
# The scrub is approved. Do not run it yet.
# This repo is public. Run the scrub only after this core deletion is merged
# and the service tree is in the private service repo. Do not contact GitHub
# Support. Do not force-push before those conditions.
# One path per line. A trailing slash is a directory prefix.
# Lines starting with # are comments and are not passed to filter-repo.
#
# These paths are Red Star site internals. The rehearsal was run against
# main 3c84eb2e (before the split). A path that still exists at the scrub
# tip is skipped, not deleted: filter-repo would also drop the kept file.
#
# Kept on purpose (not listed): assets/ (logos, banner, wallpapers,
# empty-body animation), src/eggs.rs, docs/.secrets/, src/branding.rs,
# src/brands.rs, src/prefs.rs (moved out of src/auth/ before this deletion),
# themes, crypto, storage, the TUI shell, and docs/history/.
# tests/support/mock.rs stays absent. Theme and article checks live in
# tests/support/themes.rs, which is not a scrub path.

